</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
After installation of quarter-pillar outer panel, affix side sill protection tape (1) and fuel lid cushion films (4) as shown in figure.
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IGJA0A9B0058.jpg" width = "183.000mm" height = "88.733mm" ver = "01" gw = "487" gh = "235"/>
